\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\abinodiroverride\ltrch I wore many hats beyond full-stack web developer,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}including dev tooling maintainer,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}API designer,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}version control guru}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} (}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Git,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}SVN,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}git-svn,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}GitHub, GitLab}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0})}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0},}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}code reviewer}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} (}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}GitLab}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0})}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0},}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}hybrid mobile app dev,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}software architect,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}QA automator,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}devops guy,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and sysadmin.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}I also occasionally served as top-tier support tech,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}business analyst,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and technical writer.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
