\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\abinodiroverride\ltrch I built and maintained an iOS/Android app generation framework that managed}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} ~}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}70}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}client apps,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}using Cordova,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}AngularJS,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Angular Material,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}SCSS,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}bash,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and Node.js.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}It used Cordova plugins for in-app purchasing and other features,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and I updated the Java and Objective-C plugin components as needed.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\abinodiroverride\ltrch I wrote an HTTP JSON API to support our mobile app fleet and other systems using PHP,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Lumen,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Composer,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}RAML,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}JSON Schema,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}MySQL,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and nginx.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Development Vagrant VMs and production servers were provisioned with the same Ansible playbooks,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and we used the API\uc1\u8217\'92s functional tests for black-box production monitoring.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\abinodiroverride\ltrch As sysadmin and devops guy,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}I wrangled www.nxtbook.com\uc1\u8217\'92s autoscaling multi-AZ EC2}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}herd using bash,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Ansible,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}PHP,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Node.js,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}the AWS CLI,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and the AWS Console.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}I added functional tests using bash/bats/curl and used them to monitor production,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and added automatic blocking of malicious HTTP bots with a custom fail2ban configuration for our nginx load balancers.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}I analyzed events across the EC2}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}fleet by aggregating logs with syslog-ng and analyzing the logs with standard Unix tools.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\b\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\abinodiroverride\ltrch Lead JS Developer}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}:}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}United Concordia,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}2015}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}-}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}2016}{\s13\f2\fs22\b\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\abinodiroverride\ltrch I led initial front-end development of BPIR,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}a system for defining insurance policy benefits for other tools to consume.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\abinodiroverride\ltrch I trained and mentored developers ranging from student interns to experienced back-end Java devs in building SPAs with AngularJS,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}SCSS,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}Bootstrap,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}and Lodash,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}as well as version control and code review with Git.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}I played a pivotal role in developing front-end team cohesion and camaraderie between team members,}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}turning our motley collection of devs into a working front-end team that got the project done on time and had fun doing it.}{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0} }{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033{\*\listtag0}\par}
\pard\plain\ltrpar\ql\s13\sl240\slmult1\itap0{\s13\f2\fs22\lang1033\ltrch\abiltr{\*\listtag0}\par}
